thub-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":94,"digest":"sha256:7ec8da65081e1cff65c9ca7b45fea074c01d8b0f6d0c8b77537b650b89a7646c","download_count":204,"created_at":"2026-09-28T14:51:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T14:51:33Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases/download/1.1.4/freecad_source_1.1.4.tar.gz-SHA256.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/tarball/1.1.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/zipball/1.1.4","body":"FreeCAD 1.1.4 is the last planned maintenance release in the 1.1.x series. It includes two security fixes addressing file-handling vulnerabilities that can be triggered by opening a maliciously crafted FCStd file. All previously-released versions are affected by these issues, so we strongly recommend that all users upgrade, especially anyone who opens FreeCAD files from untrusted or unknown sources.\r\n\r\n## How to download\r\nThe assets section below is automatically populated as the builds complete: if you don't see a download for your system, please be patient, the builds can take several hours to complete. Windows and macOS builds are signed by The FreeCAD project association AISBL.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* fix COIN3D_MICRO_VERSION regex for coin 4.0.10 by @moench-tegeder in #30899 (backported by PR [#31571](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31571))\r\n* core: Improve performance of fps label by @ipatch in #29628 (backported by PR [#31657](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31657))\r\n* Gui: Fix visibility icons for link group sub-items by @maxwxyz in #31559 (backported by PR [#31684](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31684))\r\n* TechDraw: Projection Group jumps to origin by @WandererFan in #27094 (backported by PR [#31687](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31687))\r\n* [Gui] fix TinkerCAD nav style to consistently show the context menu … by @Syres916 in #31631 (backported by PR [#31706](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31706))\r\n* Fix regression with 3mf thumbnail by @sliptonic in #30682 (backported by PR [#31717](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31717))\r\n* BIM: fix site ReferenceError when creating project with default structure by @Roy-043 in #31747 (backported by PR [#31756](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31756))\r\n* Gui: Fix Sketcher toolbar state not persisting across workbench switches by @ayyaz20003 in #28674\r\n* Gui: fix toolbar icon size reset after stylesheet reload by @Bojan9597 in #28998 (backported by PR [#31762](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31762))\r\n* BIM: fix another error in #30001 by @Roy-043 in #31761 (backported by PR [#31768](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31768))\r\n* TechDraw: allow precise surface finish symbol placement by @WandererFan in #31635 (backported by PR [#31794](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31794))\r\n* Draft: fix format_object for Links by @Roy-043 in #31800 (backported by PR [#31814](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31814))\r\n* [Part] Fix seg fault when opening file with faulty geometry by @Syres916 in #31812 (backported by PR [#31837](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31837))\r\n* Gui: Hide ShowPlane with its object by @maxwxyz in #31871 (backported by PR [#31946](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31946))\r\n* Replace deprecated QImage::mirrored by QImage::flipped by @Lgt2x in #27563 (backported by PR [#31989](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/31989))\r\n* [TD]expose scrubEdges to Python by @WandererFan in #29009 (backported by PR [#32013](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32013))\r\n* TechDraw: Avoid unnecessary approximation of bspline curve by @WandererFan in #29648 (backported by PR [#32063](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32063))\r\n* [TD]Line format fixes by @WandererFan in #29430 (backported by PR [#32268](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32268))\r\n* BIM: BimViews: fix IfcType error for WorkingPlaneProxy in Std_Group by @Roy-043 in #32055 (backported by PR [#32419](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32419))\r\n* Draft: flatten SVG faces (improved) by @Roy-043 in #32416 (backported by PR [#32422](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32422))\r\n* Gui: Fix splash screen rendering on macOS by @maxwxyz in #32598 (backported by PR [#32617](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32617))\r\n* Draft: fix midpoint snap for hyperbola by @Roy-043 in #32499 (backported by PR [#32503](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32503))\r\n* TechDraw: fix PAT hatch color and width by @WandererFan in #32791 (backported by PR [#32796](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32796))\r\n* BIM: Prevent flipping of v1.0.2 columns by @Roy-043 in #32244 (backported by PR [#32810](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32810))\r\n* Gui: fix splash screen positioning (wrong window flags) by @ElementW in #32834 (backported by PR [#32847](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32847))\r\n* [Sketcher] Fix `SketchObject::setConstruction` for external geometries by @AjinkyaDahale in #32891 (backported by PR [#32906](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32906))\r\n* TechDraw: honour Print Center Marks preference by @WandererFan in #31779 (backported by PR [#32941](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32941))\r\n* (cp) Gui: Set alpha value to 255 of default colors by @maxwxyz in #31729 (backported by PR [#32978](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32978))\r\n* FEM: Avoid ZipSlip by @chennes in #31878 (backported by PR [#32980](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32980))\r\n* Fem: Fix constraint symbol paths by @marioalexis84 in #32176 (backported by PR [#32981](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/32981))\r\n* App: Avoid ZipSlip in VRML texture loading by @chennes in #33017 (backported by PR [#33019](https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/pull/33019))\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/compare/1.1.3...1.1.4","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/releases/398304099/reactions","total_count":82,"+1":38,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":22,"confused":0,"heart":9,"rocket":9,"eyes":2},"mentions_count":14}